{"seq":3,"slug":"hydration-strategies","title":"水合策略与选择性水合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-server-components-ssr/foundations/hydration-strategies","wordCount":1601,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"水合策略与选择性水合\">水合策略与选择性水合</h1><p>水合（Hydration）是 SSR 架构中最微妙的环节：服务端生成的静态 HTML 已经让用户看到了内容，但要让页面真正&quot;活&quot;起来——响应点击、处理输入、触发状态更新——浏览器必须将 JavaScript 运行时与已有的 DOM 结构关联起来。这个过程的成本直接决定了 TTI（Time to Interactive）：用户看到内容后多久才能与之交互。不同的水合策略对应着不同的成本分摊方式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>水合（Hydration）是把服务端生成的静态 HTML 激活为可交互应用的过程，其成本直接决定 TTI。不同策略的差别在于<strong>成本如何分摊</strong>：全量水合一次激活整棵树，渐进式水合按优先级分批，选择性水合让水合并行于 HTML 流并由用户交互打断调度，部分水合只激活交互岛屿，零水合则完全跳过水合并按需恢复。选型的核心不是&quot;哪个最快&quot;，而是页面中有多少组件真正需要客户端 JavaScript。</p>\n<h2 id=\"全量水合-最简单也最昂贵\">全量水合：最简单也最昂贵</h2><p>全量水合（Full Hydration）是 React 18 之前的唯一选项：加载整个应用的 JavaScript bundle，从根组件开始遍历整棵虚拟 DOM 树，将每个组件的事件监听器绑定到对应的 DOM 节点。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { hydrateRoot } from &#39;react-dom/client&#39;;&#10;import App from &#39;./App&#39;;&#10;&#10;// 整棵树一次性水合&#10;hydrateRoot(document.getElementById(&#39;root&#39;), &lt;App /&gt;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { hydrateRoot } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'react-dom/client'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> App </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './App'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 整棵树一次性水合</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hydrateRoot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getElementById</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'root'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">App</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> />);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>全量水合的时间复杂度与组件树大小成正比：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{hydration}^{full} = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} (T_{download}^{chunk_i} + T_{execute}^{component_i} + T_{bindEvents}^{component_i})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4044em;vertical-align:-0.4374em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.967em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4374em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.931em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1449em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3013em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1572em;vertical-align:-0.2458em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9115em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4542em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2458em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2128em;vertical-align:-0.3013em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9115em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">bin</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3013em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对于包含 200+ 组件的电商页面，全量水合通常耗时 2-5 秒，期间主线程被完全占用。用户看到了完整的页面，但点击按钮毫无反应——这就是 SSR 的&quot;恐怖谷&quot;（Uncanny Valley）问题。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>全量水合</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>复杂度</td>\n<td>最低——框架默认行为</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TTI 影响</td>\n<td>最大——整棵树完成才可交互</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JS Bundle</td>\n<td>全量——所有组件代码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>小型应用、交互密度均匀的页面</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"渐进式水合-按优先级分批\">渐进式水合：按优先级分批</h2><p>渐进式水合（Progressive Hydration）的核心思想是：不同组件的交互紧迫度不同。页首的导航栏和搜索框需要立即响应，而页尾的&quot;返回顶部&quot;按钮可以延后。</p>\n<p>实现原理是将组件树切分为多个水合单元，按优先级排队执行：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 概念模型：通过 lazy + Suspense 实现分批水合&#10;import { lazy, Suspense } from &#39;react&#39;;&#10;&#10;const Header = lazy(() =&gt; import(&#39;./Header&#39;));     // 高优先级&#10;const ProductInfo = lazy(() =&gt; import(&#39;./Product&#39;)); // 中优先级&#10;const Reviews = lazy(() =&gt; import(&#39;./Reviews&#39;));    // 低优先级&#10;const Footer = lazy(() =&gt; import(&#39;./Footer&#39;));      // 最低优先级&#10;&#10;function App() {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;&gt;&#10;      &lt;Suspense fallback={null}&gt;&lt;Header /&gt;&lt;/Suspense&gt;&#10;      &lt;Suspense fallback={null}&gt;&lt;ProductInfo /&gt;&lt;/Suspense&gt;&#10;      &lt;Suspense fallback={null}&gt;&lt;Reviews /&gt;&lt;/Suspense&gt;&#10;      &lt;Suspense fallback={null}&gt;&lt;Footer /&gt;&lt;/Suspense&gt;&#10;    &lt;/&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 概念模型：通过 lazy + Suspense 实现分批水合</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { lazy, Suspense } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'react'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Header</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> lazy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./Header'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 高优先级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ProductInfo</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> lazy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./Product'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 中优先级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Reviews</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> lazy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./Reviews'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 低优先级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Footer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> lazy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./Footer'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 最低优先级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> App</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Suspense fallback</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{null}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Header</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> />&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Suspense</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Suspense fallback</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{null}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ProductInfo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> />&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Suspense</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Suspense fallback</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{null}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Reviews</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> />&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Suspense</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Suspense fallback</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{null}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Footer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> />&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Suspense</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"gantt\" data-source=\"gantt&#10;    title 渐进式水合时间线&#10;    dateFormat X&#10;    axisFormat %Lms&#10;    section 全量水合&#10;    整棵树水合: 0, 3000&#10;    section 渐进式水合&#10;    Header 水合: 0, 400&#10;    ProductInfo 水合: 400, 800&#10;    Reviews 水合: 1200, 600&#10;    Footer 水合: 2000, 300\">gantt\n    title 渐进式水合时间线\n    dateFormat X\n    axisFormat %Lms\n    section 全量水合\n    整棵树水合: 0, 3000\n    section 渐进式水合\n    Header 水合: 0, 400\n    ProductInfo 水合: 400, 800\n    Reviews 水合: 1200, 600\n    Footer 水合: 2000, 300</pre><p>渐进式水合的关键收益是<strong>首次可交互时间前移</strong>：Header 在 400ms 内就可交互，用户不必等待整棵树完成。但它仍然要求所有组件的代码最终被下载和执行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"选择性水合-react-18-的核心策略\">选择性水合：React 18+ 的核心策略</h2><p>选择性水合（Selective Hydration）是 React 18 通过 <code>renderToPipeableStream</code> + Suspense 引入的机制。它在渐进式水合的基础上增加了两个关键能力：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>流式 HTML 与水合并行</strong>：浏览器可以在 HTML 仍在流式到达时，就开始水合已经到达的部分</li>\n<li><strong>用户交互驱动优先级</strong>：如果用户点击了某个尚未水合的区域，React 会中断当前水合任务，优先水合被交互的组件</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant U as 用户&#10;    participant B as 浏览器&#10;    participant R as React Runtime&#10;&#10;    Note over B: HTML 流式到达中...&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;R: Shell HTML 解析完成&#10;    R-&gt;&gt;R: 开始水合 Header&#10;    U-&gt;&gt;B: 点击搜索按钮(在 Sidebar 中)&#10;    R-&gt;&gt;R: 中断 Header 水合&#10;    R-&gt;&gt;R: 优先水合 Sidebar&#10;    R--&gt;&gt;U: 搜索按钮响应交互&#10;    R-&gt;&gt;R: 恢复 Header 水合&#10;    R-&gt;&gt;R: 继续水合剩余组件\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant U as 用户\n    participant B as 浏览器\n    participant R as React Runtime\n\n    Note over B: HTML 流式到达中...\n    B-&gt;&gt;R: Shell HTML 解析完成\n    R-&gt;&gt;R: 开始水合 Header\n    U-&gt;&gt;B: 点击搜索按钮(在 Sidebar 中)\n    R-&gt;&gt;R: 中断 Header 水合\n    R-&gt;&gt;R: 优先水合 Sidebar\n    R--&gt;&gt;U: 搜索按钮响应交互\n    R-&gt;&gt;R: 恢复 Header 水合\n    R-&gt;&gt;R: 继续水合剩余组件</pre><p>选择性水合的底层实现依赖 React 的并发模式（Concurrent Mode）。水合任务被拆分为可中断的工作单元，通过 Scheduler 按优先级调度。用户事件（click、input）触发同步优先级（SyncLane），打断低优先级的后台水合任务（DefaultLane）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// React 内部的优先级模型（简化表示）&#10;const SyncLane = 0b0000000000000000000000000000010; // 用户交互&#10;const DefaultLane = 0b0000000000000000000000000100000; // 后台水合&#10;const IdleLane = 0b0100000000000000000000000000000; // 空闲水合\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// React 内部的优先级模型（简化表示）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SyncLane</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0b0000000000000000000000000000010</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 用户交互</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> DefaultLane</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0b0000000000000000000000000100000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 后台水合</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> IdleLane</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0b0100000000000000000000000000000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 空闲水合</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"部分水合-islands-架构的方案\">部分水合：Islands 架构的方案</h2><p>部分水合（Partial Hydration）采取更激进的立场：<strong>大部分页面根本不需要水合</strong>。只有包含交互的&quot;岛屿&quot;（Islands）需要加载 JavaScript 和水合，其余内容保持为纯静态 HTML。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>JS 覆盖范围</th>\n<th>水合成本</th>\n<th>代表框架</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全量水合</td>\n<td>整棵组件树</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 全部组件</td>\n<td>React 17、Next.js Pages Router</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渐进式水合</td>\n<td>整棵树（分批）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 分摊时间</td>\n<td>React 18 + lazy</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>选择性水合</td>\n<td>整棵树（按需优先）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 智能调度</td>\n<td>React 18/19 + Suspense</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部分水合</td>\n<td>仅交互岛屿</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>≪</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k \\ll n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>Astro、Fresh、Qwik</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Astro 的 <code>client:*</code> 指令精确控制每个岛屿的水合时机：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"astro\" data-code=\"---&#10;import SearchBar from &#39;./SearchBar.tsx&#39;;&#10;import Newsletter from &#39;./Newsletter.tsx&#39;;&#10;import BackToTop from &#39;./BackToTop.tsx&#39;;&#10;---&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- 页面加载即水合 — 首屏关键交互 --&gt;&#10;&lt;SearchBar client:load /&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- 进入视口时水合 — 非首屏交互 --&gt;&#10;&lt;Newsletter client:visible /&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- 浏览器空闲时水合 — 低优先级 --&gt;&#10;&lt;BackToTop client:idle /&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import SearchBar from './SearchBar.tsx';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import Newsletter from './Newsletter.tsx';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import BackToTop from './BackToTop.tsx';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;!-- 页面加载即水合 — 首屏关键交互 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;SearchBar client:load /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;!-- 进入视口时水合 — 非首屏交互 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;Newsletter client:visible /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;!-- 浏览器空闲时水合 — 低优先级 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;BackToTop client:idle /></span></span></code></pre></div><p>部分水合的数学优势显而易见：如果一个页面有 100 个组件但只有 5 个需要交互，部分水合将水合成本降低为全量水合的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{5}{100} = 5\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">100</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5%</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"零水合-resumability-范式\">零水合：Resumability 范式</h2><p>Qwik 框架提出了更激进的方案——<strong>可恢复性（Resumability）</strong>：完全跳过水合步骤。服务端在生成 HTML 时，将组件的状态、事件监听器的引用、闭包作用域都序列化到 HTML 属性中。浏览器不需要重新执行组件代码来&quot;发现&quot;事件处理逻辑，而是在用户真正触发交互时，才按需加载并执行对应的事件处理函数。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{TTI}^{resumable} \\approx T_{FCP}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1461em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mab</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>Resumability 将 TTI 压缩到接近 FCP，代价是更复杂的序列化机制和更大的 HTML 体积。截至 2026 年，这一范式尚未进入 React 生态的主流，但其理念影响了 React Server Components 的设计——Server Components 永不需要水合，本质上就是一种受限的 Resumability。</p>\n<h2 id=\"水合策略选型矩阵\">水合策略选型矩阵</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A{页面交互密度} --&gt;|高:全页都是表单/编辑器| B[选择性水合]&#10;    A --&gt;|中:交互集中在几个区域| C[部分水合 / Islands]&#10;    A --&gt;|低:内容展示为主| D[零 JS 或 Server Islands]&#10;&#10;    B --&gt; E{是否接受首次 TTI 延迟}&#10;    E --&gt;|接受| F[React 18/19 默认策略]&#10;    E --&gt;|不接受| G[考虑 PPR + 边缘渲染]&#10;&#10;    C --&gt; H{框架选型已定}&#10;    H --&gt;|React 生态| I[RSC: Server Components 不水合]&#10;    H --&gt;|多框架混合| J[Astro Islands]\">graph TD\n    A{页面交互密度} --&gt;|高:全页都是表单/编辑器| B[选择性水合]\n    A --&gt;|中:交互集中在几个区域| C[部分水合 / Islands]\n    A --&gt;|低:内容展示为主| D[零 JS 或 Server Islands]\n\n    B --&gt; E{是否接受首次 TTI 延迟}\n    E --&gt;|接受| F[React 18/19 默认策略]\n    E --&gt;|不接受| G[考虑 PPR + 边缘渲染]\n\n    C --&gt; H{框架选型已定}\n    H --&gt;|React 生态| I[RSC: Server Components 不水合]\n    H --&gt;|多框架混合| J[Astro Islands]</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>全量水合复杂度最低但成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，大型页面可能阻塞主线程 2-5 秒，产生&quot;看得见但点不动&quot;的恐怖谷</li>\n<li>渐进式水合按优先级分批，首次可交互时间前移，但仍需下载和执行全部组件代码</li>\n<li>选择性水合在流式 HTML 上并行水合，并由用户交互（SyncLane）中断低优先级后台水合</li>\n<li>部分水合只激活交互岛屿，成本降为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，Astro 用 <code>client:*</code> 指令控制水合时机</li>\n<li>零水合（Qwik Resumability）把 TTI 压到接近 FCP，本质是受限的可恢复性，Server Components 是其在 React 中的体现</li>\n<li>选型判据是页面的交互密度，而非策略的绝对快慢</li>\n</ul>\n<p>选型的核心决策点不是&quot;哪个策略最快&quot;，而是&quot;你的页面中，有多少组件真正需要客户端 JavaScript&quot;。答案决定了水合的范围，范围决定了成本。上一篇 <a href=\"streaming-ssr-principles\">流式渲染原理</a> 解释了内容如何到达浏览器；本篇解释了到达后如何激活。二者结合，构成了现代服务端渲染管道的完整图景。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"水合策略与选择性水合","id":"水合策略与选择性水合"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"全量水合：最简单也最昂贵","id":"全量水合-最简单也最昂贵"},{"level":2,"text":"渐进式水合：按优先级分批","id":"渐进式水合-按优先级分批"},{"level":2,"text":"选择性水合：React 18+ 的核心策略","id":"选择性水合-react-18-的核心策略"},{"level":2,"text":"部分水合：Islands 架构的方案","id":"部分水合-islands-架构的方案"},{"level":2,"text":"零水合：Resumability 范式","id":"零水合-resumability-范式"},{"level":2,"text":"水合策略选型矩阵","id":"水合策略选型矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"流式渲染原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-server-components-ssr/foundations/streaming-ssr-principles"},"next":{"title":"RSC 架构模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-server-components-ssr/react-server-components/rsc-architecture-model"}}